  - m_Id: 829442665472000
    m_Localized: Plan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054912
    m_Localized: Report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054913
    m_Localized: Lessons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054914
    m_Localized: Ranking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054915
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054916
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054917
    m_Localized: You
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054918
    m_Localized: 'Goal: save up cash plus a reserve for one month of living'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054919
    m_Localized: 'Goal: break even and grow your capital to'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054920
    m_Localized: 'Goal: two locations and a team, or capital of'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054921
    m_Localized: 'Plan the month: split your time and pick actions. Then press Next month.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054922
    m_Localized: Plan the month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054923
    m_Localized: 'Today''s months are used up. Meanwhile take a lesson: it is two minutes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054924
    m_Localized: Open lessons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054925
    m_Localized: This month opened a new lesson. Read it and answer the quiz.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054926
    m_Localized: Open the lesson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054927
    m_Localized: 'Cash is below zero. Change the plan before the next month: more paid work, fewer costs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054928
    m_Localized: Fix the plan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054929
    m_Localized: Time for a real business. Compare the options and choose one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054930
    m_Localized: Choose a business
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054931
    m_Localized: Chapter goal reached! Move on to the next district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054932
    m_Localized: Next chapter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054933
    m_Localized: Month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054934
    m_Localized: Revenue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054935
    m_Localized: Net profit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054936
    m_Localized: Living costs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054937
    m_Localized: Cash now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054938
    m_Localized: Change over the month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054939
    m_Localized: 'No revenue this month. Money comes only from sales: open the month plan and give time to paid work.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054940
    m_Localized: 'A loss: costs were higher than revenue. Open the full report and find the biggest cost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054941
    m_Localized: 'There was profit, yet cash went down: living costs, purchases and loan payments are paid out of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054942
    m_Localized: Profit is what stays after every cost. Keep part of it as a reserve and put the rest to work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054943
    m_Localized: Got it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 829442678054944
    m_Localized: Full report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 832375335411712
    m_Localized: "Month in progress\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839183491915776
    m_Localized: Split your time. Work earns money, but too much of it burns energy. Rest restores it, family keeps relationships warm, study builds knowledge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 842826840530944
    m_Localized: Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 842826853113856
    m_Localized: Tony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 849569226153984
    m_Localized: 'Other: one-off income, purchases, loans'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340865708032
    m_Localized: Places
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290944
    m_Localized: Your block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290945
    m_Localized: Every place has its own business and its own host. Walk in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290946
    m_Localized: All places
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290947
    m_Localized: Trust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290948
    m_Localized: In this month's plan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290949
    m_Localized: What you pick here happens when you press Next month.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290950
    m_Localized: Energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290951
    m_Localized: Family
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290952
    m_Localized: Connections
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290953
    m_Localized: Reputation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290954
    m_Localized: Honesty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290955
    m_Localized: Knowledge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290956
    m_Localized: Home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290957
    m_Localized: "Unpaid CEO \xB7 your mentor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290958
    m_Localized: Home is your base. Skip sleep and tomorrow you earn less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290959
    m_Localized: 'Pay yourself first: set a little aside before you spend the rest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290960
    m_Localized: Family is not a cost line. They are who stays when the money runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290961
    m_Localized: Tony's Bodega
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290962
    m_Localized: "Tony \xB7 runs the bodega"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290963
    m_Localized: My margin is cents a can. I live on turnover, not on markup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290964
    m_Localized: I need hands to unload. I pay right away, in cash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290965
    m_Localized: Learn a customer's name and he walks past three other stores to yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290966
    m_Localized: Pizza Bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290967
    m_Localized: "Jay \xB7 your best friend"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290968
    m_Localized: Half the deals in this city come through people you know. Sit down, I'll introduce you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290969
    m_Localized: All work again? Burn out and nobody earns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290970
    m_Localized: The people who hire sit at the next table. Buy them a slice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290971
    m_Localized: Laundromat Office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290972
    m_Localized: "Sam \xB7 your future partner"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290973
    m_Localized: A laundromat, free Wi-Fi, humming machines. The best office we can afford.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290974
    m_Localized: Plan first, then the month. Or the month decides for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290975
    m_Localized: Read the report every month. Numbers don't lie, even when you want them to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290976
    m_Localized: Pawnshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290977
    m_Localized: "Mr. Fins \xB7 lends money"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290978
    m_Localized: Money today. No questions. The interest comes later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290979
    m_Localized: Fast money is the most expensive kind. But you are in a hurry, aren't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290980
    m_Localized: I know a scheme. Not exactly clean. But quick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290981
    m_Localized: Bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290982
    m_Localized: "Ms. Lee \xB7 banker"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290983
    m_Localized: A reserve is money that buys you a calm night's sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290984
    m_Localized: Three months of costs in reserve first. Risk comes after.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290985
    m_Localized: A bank lends to those who can show a profit. Come back with numbers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290986
    m_Localized: CEO Academy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290987
    m_Localized: "Unpaid CEO \xB7 teaches the class"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290988
    m_Localized: Class is in the evening, after your shift. Nobody promised easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290989
    m_Localized: Knowledge is the one asset nobody can take from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290990
    m_Localized: Revenue is not profit. Profit is not cash. Write it down three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290991
    m_Localized: Get a full night's sleep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290992
    m_Localized: Call Mom and visit the family
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290993
    m_Localized: Open the journal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290994
    m_Localized: Unload Tony's delivery truck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290995
    m_Localized: Buy pizza for the right people
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290996
    m_Localized: Pinball night with Jay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290997
    m_Localized: Plan the month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290998
    m_Localized: Read the report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878290999
    m_Localized: Choose a business
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878291000
    m_Localized: Borrow from Mr. Fins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878291001
    m_Localized: Run the gray scheme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878291002
    m_Localized: Put money into the reserve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878291003
    m_Localized: Take a business loan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878291004
    m_Localized: Sit through the evening class
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 879340878291005
    m_Localized: Open the lessons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770899496960
    m_Localized: "My day \xB7 24 h"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079872
    m_Localized: Sleep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079873
    m_Localized: Commute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079874
    m_Localized: Food & chores
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079875
    m_Localized: My time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079876
    m_Localized: h
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079877
    m_Localized: Before next month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079878
    m_Localized: Plan your day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079879
    m_Localized: Drop by a place in the city
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 929770912079880
